.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
.Dd November 3, 2026
.Dt MK.TOOLCHAIN.GCC.MK 5
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm mk.toolchain.gcc.mk
.Nd GNU gcc
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Read when
.Va TOOLCHAIN Ns = Ns Cm gcc .
It finds gcc in the prefixes of
.Xr mk.paths 5 ,
then on
.Ev PATH ,
and sets a matching
.Va CC , CXX , LD , AR , AS
and
.Va RANLIB .
Each may still be overridden.
gcc does not cross-compile here, except to mingw-w64, with
.Ar triple Ns Pa -gcc .
On a BSD, a ports or pkgsrc gcc also gets an rpath to its own runtime.
.Pp
Not included directly by a makefile.
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Dl $ bmake TOOLCHAIN=gcc
.Dl $ bmake TOOLCHAIN=gcc ABI=mingw
.Sh DIAGNOSTICS
.Bl -diag
.It TOOLCHAIN=gcc: no gcc found
Add gcc to
.Ev PATH ,
set
.Va TOOLCHAIN Ns = Ns Cm llvm ,
or set
.Va CC .
.It TOOLCHAIN=gcc for mingw-w64 output needs Ar triple Ns -gcc on PATH
Install it; the message names the package.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr gcc 1 ,
.Xr mk.common.mk 5 ,
.Xr mk.toolchain.llvm.mk 5 ,
.Xr bmake-it 7
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Sylvain Souche
